    {
      "text": "A page from a Prudential Singapore brochure headed \"PRUShield Premier and PRUExtra Supplementary Plans: Coverage for private hospital not under Prudential's Panel and Non-Panel listings\". It works through one scenario -- a private hospital single-bedded ward, total bill S$80,000 -- showing what PRUShield Premier covers (S$68,850, John pays S$11,150) and then four supplementary options beneath it, each with its daily premium and what John would still pay: PRUExtra Premier CoPay (S$5,900, with a level-progression bar advancing him to Level 4), PRUExtra Preferred CoPay (S$11,150), and PRUExtra Premier Lite CoPay (S$7,325).",
